107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (The 4L Trophy is a legendary orienteering rally spanning France, Spain, and the unforgiving Moroccan Sahara. Reserved exclusively for students, this unique adventure strips away modern technology. Navigation is done old-school: with a map, a compass, and a roadbook. There is no GPS and no speed record to beat. The ultimate goal is to cross the finish line by covering the fewest kilometers possible, relying entirely on teamwork, mechanical resourcefulness, and the iconic Renault 4L.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
